    (comment 2 "Concept - see docs/hardware.md and hardware/bom-revA.csv"))
  (lib_symbols)
  (text "L2 47 uH DMC / coupled inductor (Isat >= 300 mA, matched) from T1S_A/T1S_B to VBUS_RAW.\nD2 SMBJ33A, U3 TPS2660 eFuse: ILIM = 100 mA, dV/dt soft-start, reverse polarity.\nC5 100 uF / 50 V bulk BEHIND the eFuse (VBUS), carries an NVS write on brown-out.\nL3/C6 input filter, U4 LMR36006 3.3 V buck (60 V), L4 per datasheet.\nNet VBUS feeds the VBUS_SENSE divider on the MCU sheet." (at 20 25 0)
